available inventory slot with a distinct item
that needs to be identified, and then I read one
scroll of ID.  If it doesn't identify everything, I
pick the most important things.  If I still have
stuff that really needs to be identified now, I
stash the stuff I've now identified, take out
other unidentified objects to replace them in
inventory so that all slots are full again, and
read another scroll.

