my inventory, that's always enough, and I stash
the remaining scrolls along with the newly identified
stuff, take out just the items I want with me, and
proceed to play.  It's then usually several stash
runs later (and a lot more accumulated loot) before
I feel the need to identify again.  Sometimes I
just read one scroll because I really only wanted
one thing identified, but I still hold a bunch of
other unidentified stuff in inventory when doing
